%% title: Roll back a Project: the fast path signs and composes nothing
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant K as API server
    participant O as ghcr
    participant GH as GitHub
    Op->>S: roll back
    S->>K: dry-run the last Serving render
    alt dry-run accepted
        K-->>S: accepted
        S->>K: take the writer Lease
        S->>O: read the prod tag, verify it, move it back, read it again
        S->>K: set the Project to Paused
        S-->>Op: rolled back, Paused
    else dry-run rejected
        K-->>S: rejected
        S->>GH: dispatch deploy in watch mode: re-compose
    end
